why: '大室家 on 一迅プラス, the ordinary shape: platform outside the brackets, series inside.

  Its stamps are why jst_date exists and are not an invented boundary. This platform
  publishes at

  15:00:00Z, which is midnight in Tokyo on the NEXT day, so every chapter of this
  series would be

  filed a day early for ever by a reader that took the UTC date.

  THE TWO NEWEST ENTRIES OF 136. episodes() therefore reads the fixture and not the
  whole feed, which

  is why the header agrees with feed_series_name instead. The subtitle is cut as the
  publisher

  synopsis (REQUIREMENTS §2).'
